{"candidate_identity":"497ee3f0708d1da70296b84b21d9f0ec483fdb7d0f04b53a4162a26cd9c72015","payload":{"contract":"translation_surface_screen_v1","entries":[{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"ca21534c3125ebbf243f543fddcd3e38c2eecd4bd93f4e947caa1c3887527124","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"6eff89836a9185315a753356e60ac180086de01ffb0956a85b695cdabf5deb8b","logical_entry_identity":"dd7f289dee7b5394f201ec7e609b3aefb87bdbbd5e2f940261ae98e9885fa7a5","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"@Target@ is blasted with anti-magic forces!","source_tag":"_t","target":"@Target@遭到反魔能量轰击！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"60529070c95a320e16afc926d31a0457ec59cfd4e911c2567a4243758c71676e","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"6f00466a926426cdc31991c144882d875a297bdf27ebeb9f8f299e958fa7b5c8","logical_entry_identity":"ef9ace3680ec1855d4d80d1b68bc3b5a4daa7e39ee572033c7af854f5de0accd","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Activating this talent enhances your reflexes to incredible levels.  Each time you are attacked in melee, you have a %d%% chance to fire off a defensive shot off in time to intercept the attack, evading it and dealing %d%% archery damage.\n\t\tThis cannot damage the same target more than once per turn.","source_tag":"tformat","target":"激活这个技能将你的反应提升到令人难以置信的水平。每当你被近身攻击，你有 %d%% 几率射出一箭拦截攻击，躲闪攻击并造成 %d%% 伤害。\n\t\t该技能每回合对同一目标触发最多一次。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"6778f8e0df36b70849d3bcbbdec102bab1e740b0dcd314b4c13fa555b759acc2","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"6f05424c79678105003bbf7ceef3b412802189bb06b85d6316db31ecd40ff7a3","logical_entry_identity":"af39ab7e70bbebb65b91b967c7a2118aa2c5f5faab9100d14792ea70b7fe4545","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"#VIOLET#*As you come out of the Dreadfell, you encounter a band of orcs*#LAST#\nYou! Give us the staff NOW and we might offer you a quick death!","source_tag":"_t","target":"#VIOLET#*当你走出恐惧王座时，遭遇了一群兽人。*#LAST#\n你！立刻把法杖交出来，我们或许还能给你个痛快！"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"636d104f3da7dbef3a1201e8e3a8a9f50b453e4a6e44f6bc6699b3d8d98d90bb","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"6f067b9c55e6b71da1163515316cd805413d46b28b84431eef68ef3fe3de9077","logical_entry_identity":"f00869c7817a33dac740492b00d98a83bed72abde3372c81cd156acc8d2bba90","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"blood drenched shortsword","source_tag":"_t","target":"血迹斑斑的短刃"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"f6b4a2b7ceff788396dda82ab980bd75430038557e5f03e08873ae45c215a926","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"6f086456bbe4ba9795f7eadab0b14357503405b2118220fd1e305ecb7c2629b0","logical_entry_identity":"4806e33d431f40fc60e912d0c3c15479bf70ca51a50618361a2476847c711dc7","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"You know how to make the most out of being unseen.\n\t\tWhen striking from stealth, your attacks are automatically critical if the target does not notice you just before you land it.  (Spell and mind attacks critically strike even if the target notices you.)\n\t\tYour critical multiplier against targets that cannot see you is increased by up to %d%%. (You must be able to see your target and the bonus is reduced from its full value at range 3 to 0 at range 10.)\n\t\tAlso, after exiting stealth for any reason, the critical multiplier persists for %d turns (with no range limitation).","source_tag":"tformat","target":"你充分发挥潜行优势。\n\t\t潜行状态下攻击时，如果直到命中前你的目标都没有发现你，你的攻击将自动暴击。（即使目标注意到你，你的法术和精神攻击也会暴击。）\n\t\t对于看不见你的目标，暴击伤害增加 %d%%。（你必须能够看到你的目标，并且伤害奖励随距离降低：3 格内保持满额，到 10 格时降低为 0）。\n\t\t此外，由于任何原因脱离潜行后，暴击伤害奖励会持续存在 %d 回合（不受范围限制）。"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"b5f812a1e00705fbd60bf2a07cbf841ca9d6e6191792a1ca69eb2621a18ea0e7","component":"tome","entry_revision_identity":"6f09203c15476e1140af4448b8cb6d41a223bc63567d59a07a9b2fa948cffda2","logical_entry_identity":"adc96af87190c38c3e4d67623d47ab41f187b5e2c4cf753890c1c7da99470312","normalized_path":"mod-tome.lua","source":"Rod of Annulment","source_tag":"entity name","target":"废除之杖"},{"args_order":null,"call_locator":"f9803ad5